<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        Your manager assigns you training courses. Everything assigned to you is listed on
        <a href="/training">My Training</a>, and anything still to do also shows on your home page.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="Your training list">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Course</strong>: select the name to open the course.</li>
            <li><strong>Due Date</strong>: the date your manager wants it done by. A dash means there's no deadline.</li>
            <li><strong>Status</strong>: how far you've got (see below).</li>
        </ul>
        <FluentText>
            If you've been given the same course more than once, for example a yearly refresher, it
            appears as one row. Expand the row to see your earlier assignments and quiz attempts.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="What the statuses mean">
        <FluentStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" VerticalGap="8px">
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Not Started" Color="BadgeColor.Subtle" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>You haven't opened the course yet.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="In Progress" Color="BadgeColor.Informative" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>You've started but haven't passed the quiz yet.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Completed" Color="BadgeColor.Success" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>You've passed. Nothing more to do.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Overdue" Color="BadgeColor.Danger" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>The due date has passed and the course isn't completed. Finish it as soon as you can.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
        </FluentStack>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpNote>
        Can't see a course you were expecting? Ask your manager. Training is assigned per
        person, so it only appears here once it has been assigned to you.
    </HelpNote>
</HelpTab>
